  height: 50px;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}

.content {
  flex: 1;
  overflow-y: auto;
}

.footer {
  height: 60px;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}
```

### 方案二：使用 Grid

```css
.container {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-rows: 50px 1fr 60px;
  height: 100vh;
}

.content {
  overflow-y: auto;
}
```

### 方案三：使用 calc()

```css
.header {
  height: 50px;
}

.content {
  height: calc(100vh - 50px - 60px);
